msgstr "転送用に新しいスレッドを開始するスレッドセーフ バージョン。"

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:669
#: e17536344cb444b699c7465d8bcbdded
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Sends an entire folder from server to client. ``message`` should be of the "
"form ``/file_folder <folder_path> <(ip, port)> [destination_file_path]``."
msgstr ""
"フォルダー全体をサーバーからクライアントに送信します。 ``message`` は ``/file_folder <folder_path> "
"<client_address> `` の形式にする必要があります。"

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:676
#: 88f9df0240054009a6957b13ee08f2ef
msgid ""
"Sends multiple items to multiple clients. The message format is "
"``/multiple_file_multiple_client <item1> <item2> ... <(ip, port)1> <(ip, "
"port)2> ... [destination]``; every token is classified on its own (a ``(ip, "
"port)`` literal is a target, anything else is an item), so items and targets"
" may be interleaved. Each item is dispatched as a file or as a folder "
"depending on what it is on disk, and an optional trailing destination path "
"is accepted."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:688
#: 39b67f1d0e6b438386eb04c6d44da6b8
msgid ""
"Sends different file lists to different clients. Files that appear before a "
"group of client addresses are sent to that group; a new group starts as soon"
" as a file token follows one or more addresses. Example: "
"``/diff_multiple_file_diff_multiple_client a.txt b.txt (ip1,port1) "
"(ip2,port2) c.txt (ip3,port3)`` — ``a.txt`` and ``b.txt`` go to "
"``(ip1,port1)`` and ``(ip2,port2)``, ``c.txt`` to ``(ip3,port3)``. An "
"optional trailing destination path is accepted."
msgstr ""

